<title>SPAIN: Banco Popular '96 net consolid profit up 5.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco Popular '96 net consolid profit up 5.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular gave the following 1996 results</p>
<p>			    (billion pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p>					  1996		 1995</p>
<p> Net consolidated profit	  65.37	vs    61.76</p>
<p> Net attributable profit	  61.00	vs    57.48</p>
<p> Pretax profit			97.21	vs    92.86</p>
<p> Ordinary income		   233.21	vs   220.78</p>
<p> Operating income		  119.92	vs   114.03</p>
</text>
